dxe4 9. Nxe4 Nxe4 10. Bxe4 Nf6 11. Bc2 c5 12. Bg5 Be7 13. Qe2 h6 14. Bh4 Nd7
15. Bg3 cxd4 16. Nxd4 Qb6 17. Rad1 Bf6 18. Nb5 a6 19. Bc7 Qc5 20. Bd6 Qg5 21.
f4 Qh4 22. Nc7 Rb8 23. g3 Qh3 24. f5 e5 25. Bxf8 Kxf8 26. Nd5 Bd8 27. b4 f6 28.
Be4 h5 29. Ne3 Bb6 30. c5 Nxc5 31. Bg2 {Source: The People, Sunday 28 April
1907, p14. Contributed by Gerard Killoran, 4 Feb 2019. "Shoosmith beat Kagan
by altogether outplaying him in first-class style. Kagan could not stand the
quiet, deliberate method of his opponent, and seemed quite surprised that his
vigorously played moves should not have altered his opponent's placid
countenance in the slightest degree. This was the first game finished." (The
Field, 6 Apr 1907)} 1-0

